            <title><![CDATA[The Perl and Raku Foundation by the Numbers]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Olaf analyses 25 years of financial data regarding The Perl and Raku Foundation (TPRF) from the public records of IRS filings. According to Olaf's report, TPRF suffered a significant downturn after 2020 due to the pandemic and conference declines, but recovered strongly in 2024-2025.]]></description>
