        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Ex::Op: A drop-in replacement for Exporter]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Ex::Op is the swift, XS alternative to Perl’s classic Exporter, and uses a new op keyword. It speeds up module imports and loop executions considerably by removing call frames, as well as the costs of passing @_.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.10.22</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://lnation.org/blog/ex-op-a-drop-in-replacement-for-exporter</guid>
